  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### PlotGK theme test\nSame `PlotGK` call rendered dark (default `$DCTTheme`) and `Theme -> \"Publication\"`. Synthetic g(k) spectra.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Module[{mkSpec, specs},\n  mkSpec[file_, kPeak_, amp_] := Module[{tau, k, g},\n    tau = 10.^Range[-4., 0., 0.08]; k = 1./tau;\n    g = amp Exp[-((Log10[k] - Log10[kPeak])^2)/(2 0.3^2)];\n    <|\"File\" -> file, \"Spec\" -> <|\"Tau\" -> tau, \"g\" -> g|>|>];\n  specs = {\n    mkSpec[\"E1_10uM.txt\", 50., 1.0*^-6],\n    mkSpec[\"E1_100uM.txt\", 120., 1.3*^-6],\n    mkSpec[\"E1_500uM.txt\", 300., 0.9*^-6]};\n  Column[{\n    DCTPlots`PlotGK[specs],\n    DCTPlots`PlotGK[specs, DCTPlots`Theme -> \"Publication\"]\n  }, Spacings -> 2]\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"23243\" data-output-id=\"94\" data-out-n=\"762\" data-sub-idx=\"0\" data-output-format=\"Auto\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"15\" data-sub-start=\"0\" data-sub-end=\"13\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[762]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\\\Users\\\\Bob Lansdorp\\\\Documents\\\\DCT\\\\img\\\\runTests\\\\wl_16xh0xxkykgu0.svg\" width=\"983\" height=\"1064\" src=\"img/runTests/wl_16xh0xxkykgu0.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\nModule[{mkSpec, specs},\n  mkSpec[file_, kPeak_, amp_] := Module[{tau, k, g},\n    tau = 10.^Range[-4., 0., 0.08]; k = 1./tau;\n    g = amp Exp[-((Log10[k] - Log10[kPeak])^2)/(2 0.3^2)];\n    <|\"File\" -> file, \"Spec\" -> <|\"Tau\" -> tau, \"g\" -> g|>|>];\n  specs = {\n    mkSpec[\"E1_10uM.txt\", 50., 1.0*^-6],\n    mkSpec[\"E1_100uM.txt\", 120., 1.3*^-6],\n    mkSpec[\"E1_500uM.txt\", 300., 0.9*^-6]};\n  Column[{\n    DCTPlots`PlotGK[specs],\n    DCTPlots`PlotGK[specs, DCTPlots`Theme -> \"Publication\"]\n  }, Spacings -> 2]\n]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
